OL,3,GNEWSAParents, teachers and pupils have
OL,4,Atheir say on restricting phones in
OL,5,Aschools
OL,6,
OL,7,FParents and teachers are being asked
OL,8,Ffor their views on restricting mobile
OL,9,Fphones in schools, with Wales' largest
OL,10,Fteaching union calling for a national
OL,11,Fban.
OL,13,FNASUWT Cymru said its members in
OL,14,Fschools where phones are already banned
OL,15,Fhave found it "transformational" with
OL,16,Fimproved learner engagement and
OL,17,Fbehaviour. Parents and teachers are
OL,18,Fbeing asked for their views.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
