OL,3,GNEWSAParents, teachers and pupils have
OL,4,Atheir say on restricting phones in
OL,5,Aschools
OL,6,
OL,7,FForcing schools to ban mobile phones
OL,8,Fhas been ruled out by the Welsh
OL,9,Fgovernment but it has promised to
OL,10,Fstrengthen national guidance.
OL,12,FEducation Minister Anna Brychan said
OL,13,Fthere would be an expectation that the
OL,14,Fuse of mobile phones is restricted
OL,15,Fduring the school day, but approaches
OL,16,Fcould vary across school sites.
